        <mxCell id="Gtm_dYAHgq5e6AEJBvlU-4" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center; font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height: 180%; font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;VM内不运行spdk，通过内核态driver（virtio-SCSI PCI driver）访问vhost device;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;QEMU为VM创建一个&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot; color=&quot;#cc0000&quot;&gt;虚拟PCI device&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;；并且在VM外虚拟出一个&lt;b&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#009900&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;virtio-SCSI device&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;VM的内核里有&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot; color=&quot;#004c99&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;virtio-SCSI PCI driver&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;，访问VM的&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot; color=&quot;#cc0000&quot;&gt;虚拟PCI device&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;；&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot; color=&quot;#cc0000&quot;&gt;虚拟PCI device&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;把请求路由给QEMU的&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#009900&quot;&gt;virtio-SCSI device.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;QEMU的&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot; color=&quot;#009900&quot;&gt;virtio-SCSI device&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;通过vhost protocol实现：即control plane在qemu中，data plane被offload到SPDK vhost user process.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;设备初始化过程，即为VM创建一个虚拟盘：&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;vhost-user driver (master) 和SPDK vhost协商feature；结果是双方支持的feature的交集；&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;vhost-user driver (master) 把内存共享给SPDK vhost；&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;(optional) vhost-user driver (master) 向 SPDK vhost 请求disk config信息，例如disk geometry；这一步是optional的，因为它也可以通过标准的SCSI协议来询问disk config；&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;vhost-user driver (master) 向 SPDK vhost 请求 max supported queues;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;vhost-user driver (master) 把队列信息发给 SPDK vhost；&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;VM的磁盘IO：&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Roboto, sans-serif&quot; color=&quot;#212529&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;VM和SPDK vhost的数据交换是通过共享内存实现；&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;&quot;&gt;The front-end sends I/O by allocating proper buffers in shared memory, filling the request data, and putting guest addresses of those buffers into virtqueues.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;SPDK vhost polling virtqueues，接收并处理请求。注意：virtio + vhost(kernel module)方案中，需要通过eventfd通知vhost(kernel module)去处理；这里SPDK是主动poll的。&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;Once I/O completes, SPDK vhost fills the response buffer with proper data and interrupts the guest by doing an eventfd_write on the call descriptor for proper virtqueue.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;注意：和virtio + vhost(kernel module)方案一样，这是VM的device向VM的CPU发中断。&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Roboto, sans-serif&quot; color=&quot;#212529&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;VM端是正常的内核态driver，所以需要处理中断。不够高效。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fillColor=none;gradientColor=none;strokeColor=none;" parent="3VNemz-pRAIv7R2D0i4o-22" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry width="1290" height="690" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="fnbL8i0TlctTYLvcvMNN-4" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;VM使用virtio-SCSI PCI driver (&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px; background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;内核态&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 16px; background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;) 消费vhost服务&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;container=0;" parent="3VNemz-pRAIv7R2D0i4o-22" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="376.6700000000001" y="20" width="536.6666666666667" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="TEmsmb8p30stuU_N5ZZw-1" value="" style="group;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;" parent="1" vertex="1" connectable="0">
          <mxGeometry x="-280" y="-602" width="1290" height="760" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="3VNemz-pRAIv7R2D0i4o-20" value="" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;container=0;" parent="TEmsmb8p30stuU_N5ZZw-1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry width="1290" height="760" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="3VNemz-pRAIv7R2D0i4o-23" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;VM使用spdk virtio diver (用户态) 消费vhost服务&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;container=0;" parent="TEmsmb8p30stuU_N5ZZw-1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="376.6700000000001" y="20" width="536.6666666666667" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="LHnapDFJZool4tOy1VHM-3" value="VM里也是用户态driver，所以没有中断处理的问题。" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;container=0;" parent="TEmsmb8p30stuU_N5ZZw-1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="525" y="200" width="370" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="3VNemz-pRAIv7R2D0i4o-4" value="" style="shape=image;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=default;verticalAlign=top;aspect=fixed;imageAspect=0;image=data:image/png,;container=0;" parent="TEmsmb8p30stuU_N5ZZw-1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="45" y="60" width="1200" height="665" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="3VNemz-pRAIv7R2D0i4o-5" value="&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;spdk&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;user mode virtio driver&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;(virtio-PCIe)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;polling方式，不处理中断&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#CC0000;container=0;strokeWidth=2;" parent="TEmsmb8p30stuU_N5ZZw-1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="176" y="280" width="169" height="90" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="3VNemz-pRAIv7R2D0i4o-7" value="&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;spdk&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;block device abstraction layer&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;(virtio scsi/blk module)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeColor=#CC0000;fillColor=#f8cecc;container=0;strokeWidth=2;" parent="TEmsmb8p30stuU_N5ZZw-1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="176" y="200" width="169" height="74" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="3VNemz-pRAIv7R2D0i4o-9" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot; color=&quot;#cc0000&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;此处中断是vhost协议定义的&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot; color=&quot;#cc0000&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;应该还有&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fillColor=default;container=0;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=2;" parent="TEmsmb8p30stuU_N5ZZw-1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="879" y="479" width="180" height="45" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="3VNemz-pRAIv7R2D0i4o-10" value="user&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;application&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;container=0;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#CC0000;strokeWidth=2;" parent="TEmsmb8p30stuU_N5ZZw-1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="206.5" y="148" width="100" height="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ET-J5BVwQKDNzulLYPON-2" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;SPDK&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" parent="TEmsmb8p30stuU_N5ZZw-1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="412" y="202" width="60" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="fnbL8i0TlctTYLvcvMNN-1" value="" style="group;fillColor=none;" parent="1" vertex="1" connectable="0">
          <mxGeometry x="-280" y="238" width="1290" height="690" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="fnbL8i0TlctTYLvcvMNN-2" value="&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center; font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height: 180%;&quot;&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;VM内运行spdk，通过用户态driver（spdk virtio driver）访问vhost device;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;spdk virtio driver和spdk nvme driver一样，使用polling模式，而不是处理中断；所以更高效；&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;spdk virtio driver有两种使用方式：&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;PCI - This is the standard mode of operation when used in a guest virtual machine, where QEMU has presented the virtio controller as a virtual PCI device.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;vhost-user - Can be used to connect to a vhost socket directly on the same host.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;这里是第一种 (PCI)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fillColor=none;gradientColor=none;strokeColor=none;" parent="fnbL8i0TlctTYLvcvMNN-1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry width="1290" height="690" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="fnbL8i0TlctTYLvcvMNN-5" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;VM使用spdk virtio diver (用户态) 消费vhost服务&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;container=0;" parent="fnbL8i0TlctTYLvcvMNN-1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="376.6700000000001" y="20" width="536.6666666666667" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="_e00VZ1BnNWXDZaGarCc-11" value="&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;line-height: 180%;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(21, 21, 21); font-family: &amp;quot;Red Hat Text&amp;quot;, RedHatText, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;The virtio specification is based on two elements:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(21, 21, 21); font-family: &amp;quot;Red Hat Text&amp;quot;, RedHatText, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;devices and drivers. In a typical implementation, the hypervisor (Qemu) exposes the virtio devices to the guest through a number of transport methods (PCI, mmio). By design they look like physical devices to the guest within the virtual machine (其实，对于virtio-device/para-virtualized device，guest还是知道它们不是physical device的； 对于emulated-device/full-virtualized device，guest不知道).&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(21, 21, 21); font-family: &amp;quot;Red Hat Text&amp;quot;, RedHatText, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;Yuanguo: 引入vhost之后(见下文)，可以认为virtio-* device由两部分构成：control plane和data plane。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(21, 21, 21); font-family: &amp;quot;Red Hat Text&amp;quot;, RedHatText, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;vhost就是把data plane offload到别的地方：host kernel里，或者host的user-process里&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(21, 21, 21); font-family: &amp;quot;Red Hat Text&amp;quot;, RedHatText, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;即使被offload，&lt;/span&gt;逻辑上它们是一体的。看下面&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px; text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;virtio + vhost (kernel module)方案：&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(21, 21, 21); font-family: &amp;quot;Red Hat Text&amp;quot;, RedHatText, Arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;vIRQ是从backend(也叫handler)发给KVM (vCPU)的，可见backend是device的一部分。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(21, 21, 21); font-family: &amp;quot;Red Hat Text&amp;quot;, RedHatText, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot;&gt;The typical (and easiest) way to expose a virtio device is through PCI. Real PCI hardware exposes its configuration space using a specific physical memory address range (i.e., the driver can read or write the device’s registers by accessing that memory range) and/or special processor instructions. In the VM world, the hypervisor (Qemu) captures accesses to that memory range and performs device emulation, exposing the same memory layout that a real machine would have and offering the same responses. The virtio specification also defines the layout of its PCI Configuration space, so implementing it is straightforward.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(21, 21, 21); font-family: &amp;quot;Red Hat Text&amp;quot;, RedHatText, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;When the guest boots and uses the PCI/PCIe auto discovering mechanism, the virtio devices identify themselves wit the PCI&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Red Hat Text, RedHatText, Arial, sans-serif&quot; color=&quot;#151515&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;vendor ID and their PCI Device ID. The guest’s kernel uses these identifiers to know which driver must handle the device。也就是，通过PCI vendorID和deviceID找driver。这和物理机一样，只不过vendorID和deviceID是虚拟出来的。所有virtio device的vendorID都是&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(62, 67, 73); font-family: serif; font-size: medium;&quot;&gt;0x1af4 (Red Hat, Inc.)；&lt;/span&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Red Hat Text, RedHatText, Arial, sans-serif&quot; color=&quot;#151515&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;deviceID 0x1003是virtio console, 0x1001是SCSI storage controller等等，可以在https://www.pcilookup.com/ 查询。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;the virtqueue&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; color: rgb(34, 35, 36); font-family: NotoSans, &amp;quot;Noto Sans CJK SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;shares data between the guest OS (指guest OS里的virtio-* driver) and the VMM。这里措辞不够严谨： VMM就是VM Monitor即Qemu，在此指的是Qemu里的virtio-* device data plane。若data plane被offload到别处呢？就不在VMM里了。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;In addition, the virtio specification also defines bi-directional notifications:&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;Available Buffer Notification&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: var(--pfe-theme--font-weight--normal,400); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(21, 21, 21); font-family: var(--rh-font-family-body-text,RedHatText,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif);&quot;&gt;: Used by the driver to signal there are buffers that are ready to be processed by the device. (virtio-* driver&amp;nbsp; ==&amp;gt; virtio-* device data plane)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Used Buffer Notification&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-weight: var(--pfe-theme--font-weight--normal,400); font-family: var(--rh-font-family-body-text,RedHatText,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif); color: rgb(21, 21, 21);&quot;&gt;: Used by the device to signal that it has finished processing some buffers. （virtio-* device data plane ==&amp;gt; virtio-* driver）&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;In the PCI case, the guest (virtio-* driver) sends the available buffer notification by writing to a specific memory address, and the device (in this case, QEMU) uses a vCPU interrupt to send the used buffer notification.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin-block: 0px; line-height: var(--pfe-theme--line-height,1.5); font-family: &amp;quot;Red Hat Text&amp;quot;, RedHatText, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(21, 21, 21); margin-bottom: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;The virtio specification also allows the notifications to be enabled or disabled dynamically. That way, devices and drivers can batch buffer notifications or even actively poll for new buffers in virtqueues (busy polling). This approach is better suited for high traffic rates. (Yuanguo： 两端都能够使用polling模式。virtio-* driver端：例如VM里不使用内核态virtio-* driver，而是运行SPDK的用户态virtio driver； virtio-* device端：即把backend offload到host的user space process，例如SPDK的vhost target)。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 15px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; color: rgb(34, 35, 36); font-family: NotoSans, &amp;quot;Noto Sans CJK SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 #0000; color: rgb(21, 21, 21); font-family: &amp;quot;Red Hat Text&amp;quot;, RedHatText, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;The&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(21, 21, 21); font-family: &amp;quot;Red Hat Text&amp;quot;, RedHatText, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;control plane for virtio is implemented in the qemu process based on the virtio spec however the data plane is not (所以上图只是理论上的，生产环境中没有这样的方案).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;If we simply implemented the virtio spec data plane in qemu (就像上图) we’d have a context switch for every packet going from the kernel to the guest, and vice versa. This is an expensive operation that adds latency and requires more processing time (remember that qemu is yet another Linux process), so we want to avoid it if possible.&amp;nbsp; 即引入vhost，见下面两种方案。&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-1640" y="-4280" width="1160" height="800" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="_e00VZ1BnNWXDZaGarCc-29" value="&lt;ul style=&quot;line-height: 180%;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: var(--rh-font-family-body-text,RedHatText,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif); font-weight: var(--pfe-theme--font-weight--normal,400); color: rgb(21, 21, 21); background-color: initial; box-sizing: border-box; --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 #0000;&quot;&gt;vhost protocol&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: var(--rh-font-family-body-text,RedHatText,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif); font-weight: var(--pfe-theme--font-weight--normal,400); color: rgb(21, 21, 21); background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;- A protocol that allows the virtio data plane implementation to be offloaded to another&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica;&quot;&gt;component&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;called&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: var(--rh-font-family-body-text,RedHatText,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif); background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#4d9900&quot;&gt;handler&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: var(--rh-font-family-body-text,RedHatText,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif); font-weight: var(--pfe-theme--font-weight--normal,400); color: rgb(21, 21, 21); background-color: initial;&quot;&gt; (user process or kernel module - 上图是kernel module) in order to enhance performance. 所以handler和data plane是同一组件。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;RedHatText, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif&quot; color=&quot;#151515&quot;&gt;Vhost (这里指vhost handler) does not emulate a complete virtio PCI adapter. Instead it restricts itself to virtqueue operations only. QEMU is still used to perform virtio feature negotiation and live migration, for example. This means a vhost driver is not a self-contained virtio device implementation, it depends on userspace (Qemu) to handle the control plane while the data plane is done in-kernel.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(21, 21, 21); font-family: &amp;quot;Red Hat Text&amp;quot;, RedHatText, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: var(--pf-c--FontSize,var(--pf-c-content--FontSize,1rem)); font-weight: var(--pfe-theme--font-weight--normal,400);&quot;&gt;Using the vhost protocol, the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-family: &amp;quot;Red Hat Text&amp;quot;, RedHatText, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: var(--pf-c--FontSize,var(--pf-c-content--FontSize,1rem));&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#cc0000&quot;&gt;master&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(21, 21, 21); font-family: &amp;quot;Red Hat Text&amp;quot;, RedHatText, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: var(--pf-c--FontSize,var(--pf-c-content--FontSize,1rem)); font-weight: var(--pfe-theme--font-weight--normal,400);&quot;&gt; (应该是指Qemu里的virtio control plane&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(21, 21, 21); font-family: &amp;quot;Red Hat Text&amp;quot;, RedHatText, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: var(--pf-c--FontSize,var(--pf-c-content--FontSize,1rem)); font-weight: var(--pfe-theme--font-weight--normal,400);&quot;&gt;) sends the following configuration information to vhost handler:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(21, 21, 21); font-size: var(--pf-c--FontSize,var(--pf-c-content--FontSize,1rem)); font-weight: var(--pfe-theme--font-weight--normal,400); font-family: var(--rh-font-family-body-text,RedHatText,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif);&quot;&gt;The hypervisor’s memory layout. This way, the handler (即data plane) can locate the virtqueues and buffer within the hypervisor’s memory space。这里说，handler可以找到hypervisor/Qemu内存中的virtqueue，但从很多图上看到，virtqueue在VM的virtio driver的内存中。因为VM的内存空间在Qemu的内存之内，所以，这么说也没问题。更准确地说：the handler (即data plane) can locate the virtqueues and buffer within the VM&#39;s virtio driver.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(21, 21, 21); font-size: var(--pf-c--FontSize,var(--pf-c-content--FontSize,1rem)); font-weight: var(--pfe-theme--font-weight--normal,400); font-family: var(--rh-font-family-body-text,RedHatText,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif);&quot;&gt;A pair of file descriptors that are used for the handler to send and receive the notifications defined in the virtio spec. These file descriptors are shared between the handler and KVM so they can communicate directly without requiring the hypervisor’s intervention. Note that this notifications can still be dynamically disabled per virtqueue。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;line-height: 180%;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica; font-weight: var(--pfe-theme--font-weight--normal,400);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Red Hat Text&amp;quot;, RedHatText, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: var(--pfe-theme--font-weight--normal,400); color: rgb(21, 21, 21); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;After this process, the hypervisor will no longer process packets (read or write to/from the virtqueues). Instead, the data plane will be completely offloaded to the handler, which can now access the virtqueues’ memory region directly as well as send and receive notifications directly to and from the guest.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: Helvetica;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: &amp;quot;Red Hat Text&amp;quot;, RedHatText, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(21, 21, 21); font-weight: var(--pfe-theme--font-weight--normal,400); box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;The hypervisor is the&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(21, 21, 21); font-weight: var(--pfe-theme--font-weight--normal,400);&quot;&gt;leader of the protocol (即&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#cc0000&quot;&gt;vhost master&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(21, 21, 21); font-weight: var(--pfe-theme--font-weight--normal,400);&quot;&gt;), the offloading device is a &lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#006600&quot;&gt;handler&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(21, 21, 21); font-weight: var(--pfe-theme--font-weight--normal,400);&quot;&gt; and any of them can send messages.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;serif&quot;&gt;总之：&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;line-height: 150%;&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Times New Roman&quot;&gt;control plan负责device初始化：control plane通过vhost协议定义的消息(由ioctl承载)和data plane交互：&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;line-height: 150%;&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;otZIrvfBh5GYwzI6k3E8&quot;&gt;协商feature&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;otZIrvfBh5GYwzI6k3E8&quot;&gt;设置memory layout&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;otZIrvfBh5GYwzI6k3E8&quot;&gt;建立virtqueue、eventfd和irqfd&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;otZIrvfBh5GYwzI6k3E8&quot;&gt;data plane负责device运行：&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;otZIrvfBh5GYwzI6k3E8&quot;&gt;virtqueue传递数据&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;otZIrvfBh5GYwzI6k3E8&quot;&gt;eventfd和irqfd传递通知和中断: VM把数据buffer放入virtqueue之后，使用eventfd通知data plane; data plane(VM的device)处理完之后，使用irqfd向VM的CPU发中断(类别物理外设向物理CPU发中断)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=16;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-1640" y="-2600" width="1160" height="840" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="_e00VZ1BnNWXDZaGarCc-44" value="&lt;ul style=&quot;font-size: 16px; line-height: 180%;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-family: var(--rh-font-family-body-text,RedHatText,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif); font-weight: var(--pfe-theme--font-weight--normal,400); color: rgb(21, 21, 21); background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 #0000;&quot;&gt;vhost protocol&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;- A protocol that allows the virtio dataplane implementation &lt;/font&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: var(--rh-font-family-body-text,RedHatText,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif); font-weight: var(--pfe-theme--font-weight--normal,400); color: rgb(21, 21, 21); background-color: initial;&quot;&gt;to be offloaded to another element (user process or kernel module -上图是user process) in order to enhance performance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;virtio + vhost (user process): the vritqueue&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(34, 35, 36); font-family: NotoSans, &amp;quot;Noto Sans CJK SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;PingFang SC&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Microsoft YaHei&amp;quot;, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;shares data between the guest OS and the&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: serif; background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252);&quot;&gt;user process.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: serif; background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(62, 67, 73); font-family: &amp;quot;goudy old style&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;minion pro&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;bell mt&amp;quot;, Georgia, &amp;quot;Hiragino Mincho Pro&amp;quot;, serif; font-size: 17px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;vhost-user protocol is aiming to complement the&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;font-family: Consolas, Menlo, &amp;quot;Deja Vu Sans Mono&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Bitstream Vera Sans Mono&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 0.9em; background-color: rgb(236, 240, 243); color: rgb(34, 34, 34);&quot; class=&quot;docutils literal notranslate&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;hyphens: none;&quot; class=&quot;pre&quot;&gt;ioctl&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(62, 67, 73); font-family: &amp;quot;goudy old style&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;minion pro&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;bell mt&amp;quot;, Georgia, &amp;quot;Hiragino Mincho Pro&amp;quot;, serif; font-size: 17px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;interface used to control the vhost implementation in the Linux kernel. It implements the control plane needed to establish virtqueue sharing with a user space process on the same host. It uses communication over a Unix domain socket to share file descriptors in the ancillary data of the message. 对vhost的补充（或者替换?）：vhost中control plane和内核态的data plane交互是通过ioctl完成的。vhost-user是通过unix socket完成的。因为data plane是用户态的，所以叫做vhost-&lt;b&gt;user &lt;/b&gt;protocol.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: serif; background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(62, 67, 73); font-family: &amp;quot;goudy old style&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;minion pro&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;bell mt&amp;quot;, Georgia, &amp;quot;Hiragino Mincho Pro&amp;quot;, serif; font-size: 17px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 16px; line-height: 180%;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height: 180%;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: serif; background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252);&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-1640" y="-962" width="1160" height="342" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="_e00VZ1BnNWXDZaGarCc-143" value="" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;" parent="1" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry width="50" height="50" relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="-905" y="-2840" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="-795" y="-2840" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="_e00VZ1BnNWXDZaGarCc-144" value="example" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-879" y="-2870" width="60" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="_e00VZ1BnNWXDZaGarCc-1" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;container=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-1640" y="-4720" width="560" height="430" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="_e00VZ1BnNWXDZaGarCc-2" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;qemu&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;container=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-1390" y="-4720" width="60" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="_e00VZ1BnNWXDZaGarCc-3" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;container=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-1590" y="-4670" width="460" height="140" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="_e00VZ1BnNWXDZaGarCc-4" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;VM&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;container=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-1390" y="-4670" width="60" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="_e00VZ1BnNWXDZaGarCc-7" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=none;container=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-1560" y="-4635" width="400" height="65" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="_e00VZ1BnNWXDZaGarCc-6" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;virtio-* driver&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;(frontend)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;container=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-1420" y="-4620" width="120" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Rnl9G9QSr9KmMglBEjPI-10" value="" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#CDA2BE;fontColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=none;spacingLeft=10;container=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-1560" y="-4510" width="400" height="180" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Rnl9G9QSr9KmMglBEjPI-11" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;control plane&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#EA6B66;fontColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=none;spacingLeft=10;container=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-1542.5" y="-4465" width="365" height="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Rnl9G9QSr9KmMglBEjPI-23" value="" style="shape=image;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;labelBackgroundColor=default;verticalAlign=top;aspect=fixed;imageAspect=0;image=data:image/png,;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-890" y="-4735" width="671.81" height="435" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="Rnl9G9QSr9KmMglBEjPI-25" value="&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin-block: 0px; line-height: var(--pfe-theme--line-height,1.5); font-family: &amp;quot;Red Hat Text&amp;quot;, RedHatText, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(21, 21, 21); margin-bottom: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 16px;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;The virtio network device is a virtual ethernet card, and it supports multiqueue for TX/RX.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin-block: 0px; line-height: var(--pfe-theme--line-height,1.5); font-family: &amp;quot;Red Hat Text&amp;quot;, RedHatText, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(21, 21, 21); margin-bottom: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 16px;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;To send a packet, the driver sends to the device a buffer.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin-block: 0px; line-height: var(--pfe-theme--line-height,1.5); font-family: &amp;quot;Red Hat Text&amp;quot;, RedHatText, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(21, 21, 21); margin-bottom: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 16px;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;These buffers are managed by the driver and mapped by the device. In this case the device is “inside” the hypervisor (qemu). Since qemu has access to all the guests’ memory it is capable of locating the buffers and reading or writing them.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin-block: 0px; line-height: var(--pfe-theme--line-height,1.5); font-family: &amp;quot;Red Hat Text&amp;quot;, RedHatText, Arial, sans-serif; margin-bottom: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 16px;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot; color=&quot;#151515&quot;&gt;Virtio-net driver communicates with the virtio-net device over PCI. After filling the packet to be sent, virtio-net driver triggers an “available buffer notification” (PCI interrupt), returning the control to QEMU (&lt;/font&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot; color=&quot;#cc0000&quot;&gt;注意: vmexit, 从内核态KVM到用户态Qemu&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot; color=&quot;#151515&quot;&gt;) so it can send the packet through the TAP device.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin-block: 0px; line-height: var(--pfe-theme--line-height,1.5); font-family: &amp;quot;Red Hat Text&amp;quot;, RedHatText, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(21, 21, 21); margin-bottom: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 16px;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;Qemu then notifies the guest (virtio-net driver) that the buffer operation is done, and it does that by placing the data in the virtqueue and sending a&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;used notification event, triggering an interruption in the guest vCPU.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin-block: 0px; line-height: var(--pfe-theme--line-height,1.5); font-family: &amp;quot;Red Hat Text&amp;quot;, RedHatText, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(21, 21, 21); margin-bottom: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 16px;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin-block: 0px; line-height: var(--pfe-theme--line-height,1.5); font-family: &amp;quot;Red Hat Text&amp;quot;, RedHatText, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(21, 21, 21); margin-bottom: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 16px;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;The process of receiving a packet is similar. The only difference is that, in this case, empty buffers are pre-allocated by the guest and made available to the device so it can write the incoming data to them.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin-block: 0px; line-height: var(--pfe-theme--line-height,1.5); font-family: &amp;quot;Red Hat Text&amp;quot;, RedHatText, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(21, 21, 21); margin-bottom: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 16px;&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;The approach contains a few inefficiencies:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 16px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 52px; margin-block: 0px; color: rgb(163, 163, 163); --pfe-theme--ui--indent: 10px; font-family: &amp;quot;Red Hat Text&amp;quot;, RedHatText, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: var(--pfe-theme--content-spacer--body--sm,0.5rem); margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: var(--pfe-theme--line-height,1.5); font-family: var(--rh-font-family-body-text,RedHatText,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif); color: rgb(21, 21, 21);&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin-block: 0px; line-height: var(--pfe-theme--line-height,1.5); font-weight: var(--pfe-theme--font-weight--normal,400); font-family: var(--rh-font-family-body-text,RedHatText,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif);&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;After the virtio driver sends an Available Buffer Notification, the vCPU stops running and control is returned to the hypervisor/qemu (vmexit: 从KVM到Qemu中的virtio-net device) causing an expensive context switch.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: var(--pfe-theme--content-spacer--body--sm,0.5rem); margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: var(--pfe-theme--line-height,1.5); font-family: var(--rh-font-family-body-text,RedHatText,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif); color: rgb(21, 21, 21);&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin-block: 0px; line-height: var(--pfe-theme--line-height,1.5); font-weight: var(--pfe-theme--font-weight--normal,400); font-family: var(--rh-font-family-body-text,RedHatText,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif);&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;The syscall and the data copy&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;for each packet to actually send or receive it via tap (no batching).&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-right: 0px; margin-bottom: var(--pfe-theme--content-spacer--body--sm,0.5rem); margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: var(--pfe-theme--line-height,1.5); font-family: var(--rh-font-family-body-text,RedHatText,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif); color: rgb(21, 21, 21);&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin-block: 0px; line-height: var(--pfe-theme--line-height,1.5); font-weight: var(--pfe-theme--font-weight--normal,400); font-family: var(--rh-font-family-body-text,RedHatText,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif);&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;The ioctl to send the available buffer notification (vCPU interruption).&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; line-height: var(--pfe-theme--line-height,1.5); font-family: var(--rh-font-family-body-text,RedHatText,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif); color: rgb(21, 21, 21);&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin-block: 0px; line-height: var(--pfe-theme--line-height,1.5); font-weight: var(--pfe-theme--font-weight--normal,400); font-family: var(--rh-font-family-body-text,RedHatText,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif);&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;We also need to add another syscall to resume vCPU execution, with all the associated mapping switching,&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;etc&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot; face=&quot;RedHatText, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif&quot; color=&quot;#151515&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin-block: 0px; line-height: var(--pfe-theme--line-height,1.5); font-family: &amp;quot;Red Hat Text&amp;quot;, RedHatText, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(21, 21, 21); margin-bottom: 16px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot; dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 16px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;In order to address these limitations, the vhost protocol was designed. 见下面&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: initial; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica;&quot;&gt;见下面两种方案&lt;/span&gt;。&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-400" y="-4280" width="795.64" height="830" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
