        <mxCell id="R7NxRwsbaFrteS3I5hau-17" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(21, 21, 21); font-family: &amp;quot;Red Hat Text&amp;quot;, RedHatText, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;When a special instruction reached, like the ones that interacts with the devices or to special memory regions, vCPU pauses and informs QEMU of the cause of pause, allowing QEMU to react to that event.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;container=0;" parent="Rnl9G9QSr9KmMglBEjPI-18" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="582" y="220" width="220" height="100" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="R7NxRwsbaFrteS3I5hau-28" value="&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(21, 21, 21); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;ioctl (vmentry): blocking; let the vCPU run until it found an instruction that needs hardware assistance; then ioctl returns (called vmexit)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(21, 21, 21); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;and QEMU knows the cause of the vmexit (for example, the offending instruction).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(21, 21, 21); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot; face=&quot;XuU6T6A1mV5twCcza21y&quot;&gt;For special memory regions, KVM marks as Read Only or not map them at all, causing a vmexit with the KVM_EXIT_MMIO reason.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px; color: rgb(21, 21, 21); font-family: &amp;quot;Red Hat Text&amp;quot;, RedHatText, Arial, sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;container=0;" parent="Rnl9G9QSr9KmMglBEjPI-18" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="582" y="330" width="220" height="140" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="R7NxRwsbaFrteS3I5hau-29" value="" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;dashed=1;dashPattern=1 2;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" parent="Rnl9G9QSr9KmMglBEjPI-18" target="R7NxRwsbaFrteS3I5hau-28" edge="1">
          <mxGeometry width="50" height="50" relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="430" y="400" as="sourcePoint" />
            <mxPoint x="906.1300000000001" y="700" as="targetPoint" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="R7NxRwsbaFrteS3I5hau-30" value="" style="endArrow=classic;html=1;rounded=0;dashed=1;dashPattern=1 2;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" parent="Rnl9G9QSr9KmMglBEjPI-18" target="R7NxRwsbaFrteS3I5hau-17" edge="1">
